<title>UK: Ashanti Q2 earnings fall 42.5 pct.</title>
<headline>Ashanti Q2 earnings fall 42.5 pct.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-08-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Three months to June 30</p>
<p>			   (million U.S. dollars unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr (cents)		0.07		   vs 0.15</p>
<p> Earnings		   7.7		    vs 13.4</p>
<p> Pretax profit	    7.9		    vs 13.5</p>
<p> Turnover		   128.3		  vs 122.6</p>
<p>Note - Ghana-based Ashanti Goldfields Co Ltd said 1997 second quarter pretax profit and earnings are net of an exceptional charge of $2.5 million for redundancy costs.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
</text>
